title: Instructions/extract_html_wiki

Commits a previously staged HTML wiki import (see `import_html_wiki`) to disk as `.tid` files. Reads the current `$:/config/FileSystemPaths` from the wiki by default — the user can edit it in the browser before this call. After extraction, restart the server once so any newly-added library plugins activate.

|!Parameter |!Required |!Description |
|`fileSystemPaths` |no |Override the rules used. One filter per line. If omitted, reads `$:/config/FileSystemPaths` from the wiki. |

''Example prompts:''

* "Extract the staged HTML import to disk"
* "Proceed with extraction" (after reviewing `Import — Proposed Folder Structure`)

